      "tolerance": 0,
      "source": "|lambda_(n+1)/lambda_n| grows LINEARLY in n (7.5, 10.3, 13.4, 16.5, 19.6, 22.7, ...), the signature of n! growth. So the expansion at q=1 is asymptotic, not convergent."
    },
